OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fand night will continue mostly dry
OL,7,Fwith clear spells and light winds.
OL,8,FThis will lead to some mist or fog
OL,9,Fpatches, with a risk of freezing fog.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FMist and fog clearing to a
OL,12,Fmostly dry day with long sunny spells.
OL,13,FPerhaps a little cloudier later in the
OL,14,Fevening with an isolated light shower
OL,15,Fpossible in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
