OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCold
OL,6,Fwith the occasional blustery and
OL,7,Fwintry showers Thursday. Less cold
OL,8,Fwith showery rain spreading south
OL,9,FFriday becoming breezy with increasing
OL,10,Foutbreaks of showery rain late
OL,11,FSaturday.
